<title>FRANCE: RESEARCH ALERT-Ferri raises Rhone outlook.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Ferri raises Rhone outlook.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>French brokerage Ferri said it had increased its forecast for the 1997 results of Rhone-Poulenc to 3.425 billion francs, or a 24 percent rise, from a previous estimate of 3.325 billion.</p>
<p>Rhone published its second quarter and first half results this morning.</p>
<p>&quot;These results are very encouraging,&quot; Ferri said. It added it kept a positive rating on the shares because of the profit growth potential, even though there is no longer a discount to the net asset value.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
